  "solution": "∵\\(\\vartriangle A_{ 1 } B_{ 1 } A_{ 2 }\\)为等边三角形，\n∴\\(\\angle B_{ 1 } A_{ 1 } A_{ 2 } =60{}^\\circ\\)，\\(A_{ 1 } B_{ 1 } =A_{ 1 } A_{ 2 }\\)\n∵\\(\\angle MON=30{}^\\circ\\)\n∴\\(\\angle A_{ 1 } B_{ 1 } O=30{}^\\circ\\)\n∴\\(A_{ 1 } B_{ 1 } =OA_{ 1 }\\)\n∴\\(A_{ 1 } B_{ 1 } =A_{ 1 } A_{ 2 } =OA_{ 1 }\\)\n同理可得\\(A_{ 2 } B_{ 2 } =A_{ 2 } A_{ 3 } =OA_{ 2 } =2OA_{ 1 }\\)\n∴\\(A_{ 3 } B_{ 3 } =A_{ 3 } A_{ 4 } =OA_{ 3 } =2OA_{ 2 } =2 ^ { 2 } \\cdot OA_{ 1 }\\)\n\\(A_{ 4 } B_{ 4 } =A_{ 4 } A_{ 5 } =OA_{ 4 } =2OA_{ 3 } =2 ^ { 3 } \\cdot OA_{ 1 }\\)\n…\n∴\\(A_{ 2019 } B_{ 2019 } =A_{ 2019 } A_{ 2020 } =OA_{ 2019 } =2 ^ { 2018 } \\cdot OA_{ 1 } =2 ^ { 2019 }\\)\n故选：D",
